    "inputs": {
      "image": {
        "node_id": "148",
        "input_key": "image",
        "label": "Image + Mask",
        "_why": "LoadImage returns MASK as 1 - alpha, so this graph repaints wherever the uploaded PNG is transparent. Nothing about the node says that - the same class loads a plain image elsewhere - so the mapping declares it and the control offers a brush.",
